{"id":"vod_bf_37867","vodId":"37867","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"WWW.迷糊餐厅","name_cn":"WWW.迷糊餐厅","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-39/373fc64792e52c6378b5de1bdb0dc41d.jpg"},"summary":"东田大辅（中村悠一 配音）是一位平凡不起眼的男子，因为家境实在贫困，于是不得不来到一间家庭餐厅打工以维持生计。东田虽然其貌不扬，却有着十分认真踏实的性格，因此深受上司和后辈的信赖。然而没过多久，东田就发现，这间看似普通的餐厅，其实有着非常大的问题。　　工作出色的女高中生领班宫越华（户松遥 配音）、活泼开朗的千金大小姐镰仓志保（雨宫天 配音）、浑身散发着魅力的轻浮男公关进藤祐太（小野贤章 配音）、沉默寡言拥有着超强灵能力的村主小百合（日笠阳子 配音），餐厅里唯一的正常人足立正广（内山昂辉 配音），在这些人的围绕下，东田会迎来怎样的打工生活呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:52:22","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/WWWmihucanting/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/WWWmihucanting/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/WWWmihucanting/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/WWWmihucanting/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/WWWmihucanting/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/WWWmihucanting/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/WWWmihucanting/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/WWWmihucanting/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/WWWmihucanting/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/WWWmihucanting/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/WWWmihucanting/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/WWWmihucanting/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/WWWmihucanting/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:19.355Z"}